  "scope": "Multi-entity combat (an actor list on stable identities, per-actor controllers, factions, nearest soft lock) and NPC spawn points (scene objects that reference an NPC definition, derived actor identities, Play preparation, two Royal Guards from spawn points); melee soft lock from the player targeting module (authored on the Ability, proposed by the targeting module, resolved by the motor on authoritative, predicted and replayed ticks, HUD indicator); runtime Health HUD through RmlUi with a native view model, drawn in the editor Game viewport; stagger as gameplay (effect movement lock predicted by the owner, looping stun reaction, death movement lock, Flinch bound to the Royal Light hit); scripted training attacker on the combat target (owner damage, flinch, interruption, dodge invulnerability and death in fresh Play); Player virtual camera rig (free-look and aim) with blending; in-Play mask switching; mask assets with four Player slots, active-mask kit and worn face-socket visual; dodge as an authored ability on the kit utility ingress with dash and facing lock; kit death timeline with terminal precedence and held final pose; optional native effect reaction binding, frozen action/clip closure, stateless checked public reaction selection shared by owner and observed poses, authoring commands/forms and fresh authoritative Play",
